{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"overall\": [\"C1\", \"C2\", \"C3\", \"C4\"],\n  \"keep\": [\"C1\", \"C2\", \"C3\", \"C4\"],\n  \"cover\": [\"C1\", \"C2\", \"C3\", \"C4\"],\n  \"lean\": [\"C3\", \"C4\", \"C2\", \"C1\"],\n  \"plain\": [\"C1\", \"C3\", \"C4\", \"C2\"],\n  \"why\": \"overall：C1最好，因为它把舍不得放手、误把痛苦当迟疑、不许自己脆弱、看见自己在逼迫疲惫的自己，以及松劲后依恋浮出完整地连起来；C2更紧凑，但少了一些关键心理细节。keep：C1保留清单最全，尤其明确写出了行动曾带来的力量、疲惫时责怪自己、连歇一下都觉得不该；C2次之，C3和C4没有明确交代那一步曾救他脱离犹豫。cover：C1最能解释珠子的并存与转变，既说明柔和亲近为何浮现，也说明他为何仍被压力推着向前，以及为何疲惫松劲却没有安心，对B1、B2、B3、B4都有充分的因果支撑。lean：C3和C4最干净，直接从不许自己松劲写到发现自己在逼迫疲惫的自己；C2多了一层略显重复的解释，C1则把自责和不许歇息展开得较细。plain：C1的“怕承认失望就是变心”“连歇一下都觉得不该”最像一个人在讲自己的处境；C3和C4也比较直接，但略有压缩；C2的“这股劲曾撑起他”稍显概括。C3与C4内容完全相同，因此各项并列。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "77051a9c-510d-48bd-aec1-107da4adb260", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261030T005034948929Z", "elapsed_seconds": 48.766, "completed_utc": "2026-10-30T00:51:23.721238+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "d6c15248ad06d70f84ea1f87a01be2cdcf891b8a3c301f82d60ad2bd879c63e9", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_